  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Providing Support to the Government of Finland for Resettlement and Family Reunification of Beneficiaries of International Protection with Their Family Members (2024-25)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project contributes to providing a durable solution to 927 beneficiaries of international protection in Iran (the Islamic Republic of), Lebanon, Peru, Rwanda, T&#xfc;rkiye, and Zambia by facilitating their resettlement to Finland, as well as contribute to family unity for approximately 40 family members of beneficiaries of international protection residing in Finland by facilitating their family reunification to Finland. The project is to run from March 2024 to February 2025.</narrative>
  </description>
